WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Grandma, can you give me Jiang Xuchen’s WeChat account?

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,600
I'll add him so we can contact him then.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,600
Do you think I'm pushing it to you?

4
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,700
When you add him, make a note of who you are.

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,100
That kid is on guard

6
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,100
A stranger added him and he failed.

7
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,700
Grandma, it's ready. I'll go back to the room first.

8
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:19,300
Go, go, go to bed early. Don't stay up late reading.

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:35,500
It's tied and printed, right?

10
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,300
Your mother worked so hard to send you to college. What happened?

11
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,700
You want to kick me away now, right?

12
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,820
I’ve been studying Mao recently and forgot about it

13
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:48,020
Study Mao. How busy are you? You are busier than the president.

14
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,420
Don't think I don't know. Someone told me

15
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:52,220
You focus on falling in love every day at school

16
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,620
I also got a necklace worth more than 10,000 yuan from the man's hand.

17
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:56,620
It seems that Song Jingni is because of the incident with Jiao Ye

18
00:00:56,620 --> 00:01:00,420
After Feng Ping cried, he thought of using Meng Xilan to take revenge.
